<%= turbo_stream_from "notes" %>
<div class="hero">
  <h1>Notes on CRails</h1>
  <p>A mini-blog on the Rails port for Crystal: PostgreSQL + ActiveRecord
     validations, ERB templates with partials, flash messages and a view
     counter. Create a note — the <code>POST /notes</code> goes through the whole
     stack, and open pages update over Turbo Streams via <code>/cable</code>.</p>
</div>
<% if @notes.empty? %>
<div class="empty">
  Nothing here yet. <a href="<%= new_note_path %>">Create the first note</a>.
</div>
<% else %>
<div class="grid" id="notes">
<%= render partial: "note", collection: @notes %>
</div>
<% end %>
